      "level": 1,
      "content": "Removing Bullets"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "First, let's start by removing the default bullets from a list. You can do this using the list-style-type property."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Example"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "html",
      "content": "1<ul class=\"no-bullets\">\n2    <li>Apple</li>\n3    <li>Ball</li>\n4    <li>Cat</li>\n5</ul>"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "css",
      "content": "1ul.no-bullets {\n2    list-style-type: none;    /* Removes default bullets */\n3}"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Browser Output"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "alt": "HTML List without Bullets",
      "src": "data:image/png;base64,"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The list now has no bullets, giving it a clean, bullet-free appearance."
    },
